
## Background Jobs (Oban)

- **Queues:** {{OBAN_QUEUES}} <!-- e.g. "default: 10, mailers: 20" -->
- **Testing mode:** `Oban.Testing`, `:manual`

### Conventions
Idempotent `perform/1`, args are IDs, `unique:` to dedupe, `{:cancel, _}` for permanent
failures. Full rules: `.claude/rules/shipkit/oban/`.
